 "operationalization": {
  "rules": [
   "HTF idea: 15m CISD (series_open, 2/2 swing, max_wait 3); stop = protected swing; decide at confirm close",
   "fixed target = prior NY trading day high (long) / low (short), prior_hilo 1D min_coverage 0.5, untaken today (running_hilo) and beyond the entry; never moved",
   "R = (target - entry)/(entry - stop) with entry = confirm close; R >= 2 on 15m -> trade 15m",
   "else: window from the 15m decision to the first of +150min / M1 touch of target / M1 touch of the 15m protected swing; earliest same-direction 5m or 1m CISD (same rule) confirming in the window with R >= 2 to the fixed target is taken (5m wins ties); none -> skip",
   "enter next M1 open after the chosen decision; exit at fixed target / own stop / 150 min"
  ],
